�Me trupheroteta kai thlipse, me pikria kai orge, e Maria katathetei te dike tes ekdokhe tou sugklonistikou gegonotos pou uperxe kathoristiko toso gia ten idia oso kai gia ten anthropoteta. Gerasmene, kataponemene kai exoriste, e Maria agnoei ten parametro anthropoteta. Gia ekeine metraei to oti to paidi tes pethane me tropo sklero kai apanthropo gia enan aprodioristo skopo, se mia epokhe allagon kai anakatataxeon.
Kathos e zoe tes ekhei arkhisei na pairnei muthikes diastaseis, e Maria apophasizei na milesei. Mesa apo te sparaktike aphegese ton gegonoton anaduetai okhi monon e tragike morphe tes meteras alla kai e morphe tes gunaikas pou askei me to idio ethos kai austeroteta ten kritike kai ten autokritike.
E diatheke tes Marias etan ste brakheia lista tou brabeiou Mpouker gia to 2013 kai ekhei anebei me megale epitukhia se theatrike skene tou Londinou.
Kritikes gia to biblio:
To muthistorema auto einai e ekdokhe tes Parthenou Marias gia te zoe tou Khristou. Aphou mia zoe oloklere akouge tis ekdokhes olon ton allon gi' aute te zoe, e Maria ekdelonei to thumo kai ten apogoeteuse tes, theorontas oti einai oles amphisbetesimes.(Irish Independent)
Tolmero kai polu sugkinetiko. (John Banville "Books of the Year", Irish Times)
E kataponemene Maria tou Tompin, gemate skeptikismo kai mnesikakia, moiazei polu pio alethine kai geine apo ten eusebe, aionia partheno tou thrulou.O Tompin einai exairetikos suggrapheas: opos panta e lurike kai sugkinetike proza tou einai to alethino thauma". (Naomi Alderman, Observer)
Me ten paraplanetika lite graphe tou o Tompin parousiazei ten istoria tes Parthenou Marias san mia istoria anthropines apoleias kai okhi san mia istoria lutroses. Gia te Maria tou Tompin den niothoume eukola eulabeia, mporoume omos eukola na tautistoume mazi tes.(Metro)
O Tompin katathetei ena entuposiako ergo threskeutikes phantasias....exairetika prototupo, apo ta keimena pou duskola xekhniountai. (TLS)"�
�Oi eroes auton ton diegematon, stratiotes pou polemesan ste mikrasiatike ekstrateia, erkhontai antimetopoi me tous rolous pou tous epiballoun oi paradosiakoi kanones kai to bioma tou polemou. Sugkrouontai, upotassontai, zoun en krupto e pheugoun. To gkiak einai to aima, o suggenikos desmos kai o nomos tou aimatos pou skiazei tis zoes tous. Me enan trakhu prophoriko logo, oi istories tou aphegountai ten apoleia prosanatolismou, ten adunamia tous na sumbibasoun tous kodikes tes paradoses me ta sunaisthemata kai te suneidese tous."�
�O Argures Liodes oute ste mese tou pouthena, dikhos xena aphtia paronta, mporouse na phonaxei ta onomata ton exi, na tous simosei mazemenous, na tous koitaxei epitelous katamata, gia na labei te duname kai na tolmesei esto duo logia gia ta xera gegonota.
Duo logia gia ta xera gegonota den epikheirese oute se argoporemenes epistoles, giati sto parelthon opote lipopsukhouse kai ethele natous ta grapsei, telika lipopsukhouse kai sten idea tou grammenou khartiou.
Tha tou eleipan kai ta blemmata tous molis mathainan, ki autos eikhe ten elpida kai ten anagke na kourniasei sta matia tous.
Alla epi eikosi ennia khronia exi alla zeugaria matia ton empodizan, ola skoteines kopies tou sumbolaiou me tis ephta, mazi me te dike tou, upographes, na men patethei o orkos siopes ekeines tes nukhtas."�

